confirm.description:
Ultimate Updater refused to update these systems through its integration API: {targets}

For API actions it never runs extra, community, helper or custom scripts (Pi-hole, Docker Compose, ioBroker, scripts.d …) and refuses the update when they would run or cannot be ruled out. Their "Install" is therefore switched off in Home Assistant and collective updates skip them. Update them in the Ultimate Updater Web UI, the CLI or its own schedule.

If you have changed the configuration of Ultimate Updater (e.g. extra updates switched off for headless mode, scripts removed), submit to allow API updates of these systems again.
